// (aligned), momentum = k x (1800 along the aim, z = 1000 (1 - d3/3000)); the reaction class
// follows |momentum| against the pawn's `Twk_Component_HitReactionThrow_NPC`
// (m_fStrongHitReactThreshold 500, m_fAnimRagdollThreshold 1000, m_fFullRagdollThreshold 3800):
